          Pasabaya.app is a <strong>free, non-commercial digital bulletin board</strong> that allows private individuals to voluntarily match for shared journeys along similar routes. We do not provide transportation, dispatch vehicles, employ drivers, inspect vehicles, or verify user identities. By using this service, you acknowledge that you travel entirely at your own discretion and are <strong>solely responsible</strong> for your personal safety, due diligence, and interactions with other users.
